OL,3,GNEWSAMother pays tribute to 'beautiful'
OL,4,Afour-year-old killed in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a "beautiful"
OL,7,Ffour-year-old boy who died in a crash
OL,8,Fin West Lothian has said his family are
OL,9,F"heartbroken beyond words."
OL,11,FTiger Munthali died following the crash
OL,12,Fon 6 November, involving a black Range
OL,13,FRover, which happened on Drumcross Road
OL,14,Fin Bathgate, between Limefield Road and
OL,15,FDrumcross Farm.
OL,17,FTiger was taken by ambulance to St
OL,18,FJohn's Hospital in Livingston, where he
OL,19,Fdied a short time later.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
