OL,3,GNEWSAMother pays tribute to 'beautiful'
OL,4,Afour-year-old killed in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 28-year-old man has been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with the crash. He is
OL,8,Fexpected to appear at Livingston
OL,9,FSheriff Court on 17 November.
